---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy, SyncSet"
  description="How SyncSet collects, uses and protects the personal information you share with us, and how to contact us about it."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="legal">
      <div class="legal__container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: 14 September 2026</p>

        <p>
          SyncSet ("we", "us", "our") operates syncset.com.au. This page explains what personal information we collect through this site, why, and what you can do about it.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit the contact form or the free Automation Diagnostic, we collect your name, email address, business name, and the answers you give us about your enquiries, tools and workflow.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't collect payment information through this site.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use this information to respond to your enquiry, generate your Diagnostic report, and follow up about our services. We don't use it for unrelated marketing without your separate consent, and we don't sell or rent it to anyone.
        </p>

        <h2>Where it goes</h2>
        <p>
          An enquiry submitted through the contact form on this site is sent to Make.com, our automation platform, which routes it into our CRM (Notion) and sends an internal alert to our own Telegram notification bot so we see it immediately. This is the same pipeline described under "How it works" on the homepage. It's what runs our own business, too.
        </p>
        <p>
          The free Automation Diagnostic is scored by Claude, Anthropic's AI model, which analyses your answers to generate your report; the report and a summary of your answers are then stored in Notion and an internal alert is sent via Telegram, the same as with the contact form.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because these providers operate outside Australia, your information may be processed on servers overseas (the EU, for Make.com; the United States, for Notion and Anthropic). We only use providers who publish their own data-protection commitments.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiry data for as long as needed to respond to you and, if you become a client, for the length of our working relationship plus a reasonable period to meet our accounting and legal obligations. If you don't become a client, we delete or anonymise your enquiry data after 12 months.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you at any time; email <a href="mailto:contact@syncset.com.au">contact@syncset.com.au</a>. We'll respond within a reasonable time.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless and collects no personal data.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy as our tools or process change. The date at the top shows the last revision.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:contact@syncset.com.au">contact@syncset.com.au</a>, Australia.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 200px);
    padding: var(--space-24) var(--gutter);
    background-color: var(--paper);
  }

  .legal__container {
    max-width: var(--max-content);
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--graphite);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal__container h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal__updated {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .legal__container h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal__container p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .legal__container strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .legal__container a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }


  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal {
      padding: var(--space-16) var(--gutter);
    }

    .legal__container h1 {
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
